en(all_found)}')\nprint(f'Brand new URNs not in restored videos: {len(new_urns)}')\nif new_urns:\n    print('Sample new URNs:', list(new_urns)[:5])\n\"","Cwd":"/home/azureuser","RunPersistent":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":60000,"toolAction":"Checking for new distinct video URNs","toolSummary":"Check for new distinct video URNs"}}]}
